    },
    {
      "id": "I7hSoommiPP_Ijc6ioiy6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8765.556094820515,
      "y": 969.3994966716655,
      "width": 754.579345703125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1204171160,
      "version": 169,
      "versionNonce": 1798378392,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786109895569,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u0022\u00D6rnek olarak zeyilname talebi onayland\u0131ktan sonra ihale bekleyen listesinde de\nzeyilname d\u00FCzenle butonuna t\u0131kland\u0131ktan sonra ihale listesine d\u00FC\u015F\u00FCyor.\u0022 Bu\na\u015Famada, zeyilnamenin hen\u00FCz yay\u0131nlanmam\u0131\u015F olmas\u0131 \u015Fart\u0131yla iptal edilebilmesi\ngerekmektedir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u0022\u00D6rnek olarak zeyilname talebi onayland\u0131ktan sonra ihale bekleyen listesinde de zeyilname d\u00FCzenle butonuna t\u0131kland\u0131ktan sonra ihale listesine d\u00FC\u015F\u00FCyor.\u0022 Bu a\u015Famada, zeyilnamenin hen\u00FCz yay\u0131nlanmam\u0131\u015F olmas\u0131 \u015Fart\u0131yla iptal edilebilmesi gerekmektedir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5t9-1Mz7JHV-a6c4hGe4O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8765.556094820515,
      "y": 1095.3369966716655,
      "width": 308.69970703125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 606163944,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 1533810920,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786109813977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u00D6nerilen i\u015Fleyi\u015F a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki gibidir:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u00D6nerilen i\u015Fleyi\u015F a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki gibidir:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5JJFcLJlzF7GyasY1PSxR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8765.556094820515,
      "y": 1146.2744966716655,
      "width": 706.1393432617188,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 675036824,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 591969256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786109813977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Zeyilname olu\u015Fturma a\u015Famas\u0131ndan, zeyilnamenin yay\u0131nlanmas\u0131na ili\u015Fkin onay\ntamamlanana kadar iptal i\u015Flemi yap\u0131labilmelidir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Zeyilname olu\u015Fturma a\u015Famas\u0131ndan, zeyilnamenin yay\u0131nlanmas\u0131na ili\u015Fkin onay tamamlanana kadar iptal i\u015Flemi yap\u0131labilmelidir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aNDqhJ1AVtUQc7RY4T_HL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8765.556094820515,
      "y": 1222.2119966716655,
      "width": 628.3995361328125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 933140200,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 765001448,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786109813977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Zeyilname yay\u0131nland\u0131ktan sonra ise iptal i\u015Flemi m\u00FCmk\u00FCn olmamal\u0131d\u0131r.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Zeyilname yay\u0131nland\u0131ktan sonra ise iptal i\u015Flemi m\u00FCmk\u00FCn olmamal\u0131d\u0131r.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P5XURKaOehu7nAZ7ECYE6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8765.556094820515,
      "y": 1273.1494966716655,
      "width": 782.1993408203125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 141077400,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 719905256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786109813977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Buradaki iptalden kas\u0131t, ilgili zeyilnamenin yay\u0131nlanmamas\u0131na veya uygulanmamas\u0131na\nkarar verilmesi durumudur.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Buradaki iptalden kas\u0131t, ilgili zeyilnamenin yay\u0131nlanmamas\u0131na veya uygulanmamas\u0131na karar verilmesi durumudur.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ctvb6q1BtVKSWXKti0z_1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8765.556094820515,
      "y": 1349.0869966716655,
      "width": 756.5393676757812,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 276527592,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 1514431720,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786109813977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ayr\u0131ca, buradaki iptal senaryosu #28758 numaral\u0131 taskta belirtilen durum ile\nayn\u0131d\u0131r. Admin yetkisine sahip kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n, zeyilname s\u00FCrecine ge\u00E7ilmi\u015F ancak\nsonras\u0131nda zeyilname yap\u0131lmamas\u0131na karar verilmi\u015F olmas\u0131 durumunda s\u00FCreci iptal\nederek bir \u00F6nceki a\u015Famaya geri alabilmesi gerekmektedir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ayr\u0131ca, buradaki iptal senaryosu #28758 numaral\u0131 taskta belirtilen durum ile ayn\u0131d\u0131r. Admin yetkisine sahip kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n, zeyilname s\u00FCrecine ge\u00E7ilmi\u015F ancak sonras\u0131nda zeyilname yap\u0131lmamas\u0131na karar verilmi\u015F olmas\u0131 durumunda s\u00FCreci iptal ederek bir \u00F6nceki a\u015Famaya geri alabilmesi gerekmektedir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NNKCEILEEYayWRSRxvqOI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8765.556094820515,
      "y": 1475.0244966716655,
      "width": 785.4793701171875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1652521112,
      "version": 123,
      "versionNonce": 959940584,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786109813977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bu nedenle, zeyilname yay\u0131n s\u00FCreci tamamlanmadan \u00F6nce iptal se\u00E7ene\u011Finin sistemde\nbulunmas\u0131 gerekmektedir.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bu nedenle, zeyilname yay\u0131n s\u00FCreci tamamlanmadan \u00F6nce iptal se\u00E7ene\u011Finin sistemde bulunmas\u0131 gerekmektedir.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
